---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Ayush Rawat">
	<article class="prose">
		<h1>About Me</h1>
		<p>
			Hi, I'm Ayush. I'm a software engineer based in India. 
			I specialize in building high-performance web applications and distributed systems.
		</p>
		<p>
			I started this blog to document my learning journey and share technical insights. 
			My interests include JavaScript, Go, System Design, and Clean Code.
		</p>
		<p>
			When I'm not coding, you can find me reading, hiking, or exploring new coffee shops.
		</p>

		<h2>Connect</h2>
		<ul>
			<li><a href="https://github.com/yourusername">GitHub</a></li>
			<li><a href="https://twitter.com/yourusername">Twitter</a></li>
			<li><a href="mailto:your@email.com">Email</a></li>
		</ul>
	</article>
</Layout>

<style>
	.prose {
		max-width: 65ch;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}
	
	h1 {
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
	}

	h2 {
		margin-top: 3rem;
		font-size: 1.5rem;
	}

	ul {
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
		margin-top: 1rem;
	}

	li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
</style>
